<%- include('dash-header') %><div class="dashboard-heading"><div><p class="overline">PERSPECTIVE, WITH A LITTLE DISTANCE</p><h1>The overnight view.</h1><p class="heading-description">What Brain understood, what deserves a second look, and what changed.</p></div><span class="insights-glyph" aria-hidden="true">✧</span></div><div class="insight-explainer"><div><span>01</span><strong>Reflect</strong><p>Bring the day’s threads together.</p></div><div><span>02</span><strong>Question</strong><p>Look for assumptions and gaps.</p></div><div><span>03</span><strong>Notice change</strong><p>See what is new or different.</p></div></div><% if(!insights.length) { %><section class="dash-panel dash-empty large"><span class="empty-glyph violet-text">✧</span><h2>Let the day become a little clearer.</h2><p>After a day with new activity, an overnight reflection can connect the dots. Its interpretation, an independent check, and a change summary will appear here.</p><small>Reflections are conversation-derived interpretations, never diagnoses.</small></section><% } else { %><div class="memory-card-grid"><% insights.forEach(item=>{ %><a class="memory-card dash-panel" href="<%= brainLink('/dashboard/memory/snapshots/'+item.id) %>"><div class="memory-card-top"><span class="kind-badge badge-snapshots"><%= {formulation:'Reflection',audit:'Second look',diff:'What changed'}[item.kind] %></span><span>↗</span></div><h2><%= item.title %></h2><p><%= item.preview %></p><div class="memory-card-meta"><strong><%= item.agent_label %></strong><time><%= formatDate(item.created_at) %></time></div></a><% }) %></div><% } %><%- include('dash-footer') %>
